Package: GEIO
Type: Package
Title: Game-Equilibrium Index Optimization for Finite Games
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Richard A.", "Feiss",
    email = "feiss026@umn.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-0409-6042"))
Description: Tracks local equilibrium-index diagnostics in simple finite-game
    equilibrium systems. Provides constructors for small games, a damped
    Newton solver, determinant-sign local-index calculations, singular-value
    near-singularity diagnostics, and conservative consistency checks for
    selected generic examples. Parameter optimization is delegated to
    'GALAHAD'.
URL: https://github.com/RFeissIV/GEIO
BugReports: https://github.com/RFeissIV/GEIO/issues
